{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1593.unity3d","item_key":"commands[19].text","source_sha256":"f83ed4a18a2fd200664f9fe88907bbda77b99dec68f33d7659c6f8738ce81d0e","ja":"奇遇ですね～。\n実は私も……5個、でした～。","zh":"真巧呢～。\n其实我也是……5个～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1593.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"85f7b3d3d70d24eb9649427f341dfd2d105032a95132e5a415c2984427dd9cda","ja":"しかも見つかったのは\n3色5個ずつ……ってことは、全員引き分け！？","zh":"而且找到的正好是\n3种颜色各5个……也就是说，大家打成平手了！？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1593.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"ddcfe2d46f1993093e7696924f3264c0fd96020cff4ad9d93224287be6f93beb","ja":"うふふ。奇跡みたいな偶然ですね～。\nこれはこれで、面白いのではないでしょうか～。","zh":"呵呵。简直就像奇迹般的巧合呢～。\n这样倒也挺有趣的吧～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1593.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"a8ac0f36b431c73605105b9cd995d5d9ff07ad72bcabe8ef7680dcb3cbda4090","ja":"うん、すっごく面白かったぞ！","zh":"嗯，超级有趣哦！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1593.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"b91c8d8bce3fd9255f1a627ce65bea9dd617261464d0318e4208a17918539f94","ja":"たまき、今度は劇場のみんなで、劇場全部を\nつかって宝さがしをしてみたいな！　くふふ♪　","zh":"环想下次和剧场的大家一起，\n用上整个剧场来寻宝呢！嘿嘿♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1593.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"85c1deb49c205ac234834b10679ac2a6ce0bd2d18660f9bcbec9fe2473ab3035","ja":"はい、ぜひ！　今日も控え室を、いつもと違う目線で\n見ることができて、大変興味深かったですし♪","zh":"好的，非常乐意！今天也能从和平时不同的视角\n观察休息室，真的很有意思呢♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1593.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"47ac8c001db15eac7efd1e803bd1b847828dc6733ed949fcd54eeca9d5f7efc4","ja":"そうね。新鮮だし、すごく楽しかったわ。\nまたやるなら、次こそは勝ちたいな。","zh":"是啊。感觉很新鲜，而且玩得特别开心。\n要是再办的话，下次我一定要赢呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
